		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=43533#p43533"><![CDATA[
I found the problem. During installation of PyBullet, the "pybullet_data" folder apparently gets copied into  <br>"\Users\&lt;myname&gt;\AppData\Roaming\Python\Python39\site_packages\", which is where the files get loaded from. Now I can edit the files.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=14051">allan</a> — Fri Jul 30, 2021 5:13 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
